"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Check the efficienty of the light and its\ncleanliness.</p><p>Connect the light to the electrical connection.</p><p>1. Insert the light in its own seat placing it as the picture shows.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018824.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Hook the check tong.</p><p>Test the functionality of the fog lamp.</p><p>Reassemble the lid and turn it clockwisely.</p>"]]